#!RuleTest
#test CDISC-SEND-9436 expect=skipped domain=SE
# Rule:Description: CDISC-SEND-9436 — the Required key USUBJID is not populated.
#note "USUBJID is absent from SE, so Requirements.Variables.All gates the rule to SKIPPED rather than firing on every row. This is the absent-column guard the standing 'absent column = all-missing column' policy makes necessary: without it empty(USUBJID) would be true on every row of every dataset that simply lacks the column. Asserts the SKIP, not merely the absence of a finding."
#library standard=sendig version=3-1-1
dataset SE
col STUDYID type=Char
col DOMAIN type=Char
col SESEQ type=Char
col ETCD type=Char
---
S1      | SE     | 1     | SCRN
---
